    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a priest, you gain the following class features.</p><h2>Hit Points</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d6 per priest level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 6 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d6 (or 4) + your Constitution modifier per priest level after 1st</p><h2>Proficiencies</h2><p><strong>Armor:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> All simple weapons</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Choose two from History, Insight, Medicine, Persuasion, and Religion</p><h2>Equipment</h2><p>You start with the following equipment, in addition to the equipment granted by your background:</p><ul><li><p>(a) a club or (b) a quarterstaff</p></li><li><p>(a) a priest's pack or (b) an explorer's pack</p></li><li><p>(a) a light crossbow and 20 bolts or (b) any simple weapon</p></li><li><p>a holy symbol, healer's kit, and a dagger</p></li></ul><h2>Class Table</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Levels</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Devotion</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1st</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.BPniAIRn38VkG0vb]{Spellcasting}, Divine Calling</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2nd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.CXTpRhJXEa78kO9p]{Devotion}, Divine Calling feature</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>ASI</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>Divine Word (2)</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>Divine Calling feature</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>Empowering Faith</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">8th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>ASI</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">10th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>Divine Calling feature, Divine Word (3)</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">11th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">12th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>ASI</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">13th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">14th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>Unwavering Faith, Divine Word (4)</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">15th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">16th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>ASI</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">17th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.r00853A5N9zfxv2E]{Prodigy of Faith}</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"52\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">18th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"268\"><p>Divine Calling feature</p></td><td